# Archivd (SPA)

Backend behavior: sibling `monolith/docs/domains/archivd/README.md` (Agent entry first).

- Views: `src/views/archivd/`. Logic: `src/composables/archivd/`. Do not `Read` `ArchivdView.vue` whole unless the task touches that SFC — prefer offset reads / Grep.
- API calls go through `src/api/client.ts` only. No JWT in JS.
- Locale keys: Grep + patch all seven JSON files; never dump `src/i18n/locales/*.json`.
- UI patterns: [docs/ui-patterns.md](../../docs/ui-patterns.md).
